Subject: [PATCH] HSYS-ENTRY (web): the status bar's Handler System entry
 (Panel71) is visible again

EastSun 20261002: the Handler System link is not on the page.  It sat inside the .srcnote footer of Status.TemperFrom.html, and LAYOUT110 (dcf921d,
0930) hides every .srcnote with display:none !important, so the only entry to HandlerSys went with it.  Moved to the right end of the second
chip row (OCR row, flex, margin-left:auto); click handler unchanged (golden Panel71MouseDown cTemperFrom.cpp:1733-1777 -> password ->
HandlerSystem->ShowModal()).  Headless Edge: Panel71 visible, on top at its centre, page height unchanged (105 px), 0 JS errors.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 page/Status.TemperFrom.html | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/page/Status.TemperFrom.html b/page/Status.TemperFrom.html
index 09c3f6e..35a363f 100644
--- a/page/Status.TemperFrom.html
+++ b/page/Status.TemperFrom.html
@@ -52,6 +52,8 @@ bShow = (INSTALL_OCR != eocrUninstal)，Caption 同條件給「OCR」或空字
 來源 /api/system/gerneral [System] INSTALL_OCR（本樹 D:\HT9045\system\Gerneral.ini）。
 ⚠ 原本寫死的「OEE ON(10.86.105.239)」是假值：golden 的 Caption 只會是「OCR」或空，
    那個 IP 在 golden 裡查無出處，已移除。">OCR ---</span>
+  <!-- AI(W906-HSYS-ENTRY) 20261002: EastSun「⚙ Handler System 在頁面上沒顯示出來」—— 它原本放在 .srcnote 裡，LAYOUT110（dcf921d）把 .srcnote 一律 display:none !important，入口跟著消失。搬到這一行的右邊；行為不變（golden Panel71MouseDown cTemperFrom.cpp:1733-1777 → 密碼 → HandlerSystem->ShowModal()）。 -->
+  <span id="Panel71" title="Panel71（Panel71MouseDown：密碼 → HandlerSystem->ShowModal()）" style="margin-left:auto;cursor:pointer;color:#369;text-decoration:underline;white-space:nowrap;">⚙ Handler System</span>
 </div>
 
